<% html_title 'Engineering issues', 'ESA' %>
<div class="contextual"><%= link_to 'All ESA tickets', esa_path %></div>
<h2>ESA · Engineering issues</h2>
<p>Engineering issues organize shared investigations. Tentative membership does not confirm a common cause. Counts include only tickets you can view.</p>
<p>Empty issues are removed automatically. Issues with engineer-reviewed knowledge are never evicted; once solved and unmatched for the retirement period they are retired, kept searchable for routing, and revived as a possible regression when a new ticket matches. Other issues are capped at 100 across all projects by least recent access. Earlier ticket reports remain in history. Browsing this list does not refresh access order.</p>
<table class="list"><thead><tr><th>Engineering issue</th><th>Engineering title</th><th>Representative ticket</th><th>State</th><th>Visible tickets</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% Array(@result['issues']).each do |row| %><tr><td><%= row.dig('issue', 'id') %></td><td><%= row.dig('issue', 'title').presence || 'Restricted title' %></td><td><%= row.dig('representative_ticket', 'subject') %></td><td><%= esa_label(row.dig('issue', 'state')) %><%= ' · Retired' if row.dig('issue', 'retired_at').present? %></td><td><% Array(row['ticket_ids']).each do |id| %><%= link_to "##{id.delete_prefix('redmine:')}", esa_ticket_path(id.delete_prefix('redmine:')) %> <% end %></td></tr><% end %>
</tbody></table>
